        "text": "Neil Verhagen (born February 18, 2001) is an American racing driver. He has been part of the BMW factory driver roster since 2023. His biggest career accolade is winning the 2026 24 Hours of Daytona as well as that year's IMSA Sportscar Championship in the GTD Pro class.\n\nVerhagen is the youngest driver to win the SCCA National Championship Runoffs, having accomplished this in the Formula F category.",
